// both candidates' strengths and weaknesses with examples and a reasoned conclusion, ≈ 180 words), 047 RÄÄK R→S (corner
// W1 = Gert's angry mail rewritten as a semi-formal note to Liis, 80–100 words; main = S16 talk at Hendrik's meeting,
// recorded at home), 048 KIRJ L→W (corner R2b = the class teacher's letter, eight answers of 1–3 words; main = W13
// semi-formal letter to the class teacher), 049 PROJ L→S (corner S2 = the quiet-hours debate with argument cards A / B;
// main = the mediated agreement meeting at Vahtra 5, S03). Every teaching lesson: review naming the previous lesson and
// a module 6–8 lesson, a pair task in the lesson, a home recording in Kasuta, two fluency tasks; S16 in 046 and 047, S17
// in 046 and 049. Module 9's words return: toitumine, menüü, suhkur, allergia, harjumus, muutuma, tervislik, uni,
