//   046 Eda's house paper introduces the neighbours (cards), a problem article on loneliness; a radio
//       interview on first impressions; the selection committee chooses a night-shift leader for Tartu.
//       Eda's paper also tells two parallel stories (Kai and her childhood friend Silvi; Valdur and his late wife Maimu): lines paired.
//   047 Gert's, Markus's and Sofia's mails; Hendrik's blog (cloze) and voice message; Sofia's call with Gert.
//       Friendship words (kadedus, viha, varjama, andeks andma), noticing a friend's trouble (Kuidas sul päriselt läheb?).
//   048 Valdur's and Jaan's voice messages to Eda; a forum thread (a post on a friend's gossip, three replies of different
